node_modules
    .env
    ```
4.  **Commit and Push:**
    
```bash
    git add .
    git commit -m "Added start script and ignored env"
    git push origin main
    ```

**Now your bot is officially ready for Railway!** Once you connect this repo to Railway, it will see `"start": "node bot.js"` and automatically know what to do. 

Shall we head over to the Railway dashboard next?